When we run the source code of our method ShareTable Value1 is written to the table of the Variable and
to the subtable of the DataTable. In the DataTable you can also unshare by clicking the button Unshare.
Variable := DataTable[1,1]
Variable[1,2] := "Value1" // Value1 appears in DataTable[1,1]
When we run the source code of our method UnShareTable Value2 is written to the table of the Variable
and Value1 to the subtable of the DataTable.
&Variable.unshare
Variable[1,2] := "Value2" // Value2 doesn't appear in DataTable[1,1]
